# Local runtime and audit evidence
agent-evidence/
docs/codex/

# docs/troubleshooting/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Those records are the
# project's durable debugging memory and the project-memory skill routes future
# work through them; ignoring the directory made the records local-only, so a
# fresh clone had no history of past failures and they were silently lost when a
# working copy was cleaned up. Generated `docs/codex/` index artifacts stay
# ignored.

